      "description": "Career Prep | University of South Carolina Skip to Content University of South Carolina Home Search University of South Carolina University of South Carolina Navigation Search sc.edu Gateways For: STUDENTS FACULTY & STAFF ALUMNI PARENTS & FAMILIES Calendar Map Directory Apply Give Search sc.edu Search Study Study at South Carolina Majors and Degrees at South Carolina Undergraduate Education Graduate Education Online Education Colleges and Schools Libraries and Collections Continuing Education Experience Experience South Carolina Living Here Dining Clubs and Organizations Sports and Outdoors Arts and Entertainment Inclusive Excellence University 101 My USC Experience Academic Support Career Prep Study Abroad Visit Visit Campus Individual Visits Group Visits Self-Guided Visits Virtual Tour Explore Columbia Campus Map Admissions Admissions at South Carolina Undergraduate Admissions Graduate School Admissions University Applications Tuition and Aid Research Research at South Carolina Research Opportunities Breakthrough Research Partnership Opportunities About About South Carolina South Carolina at a Glance Our Leadership Offices and Divisions Signature Events Our History Directory Search Employment News & Events USC News & Events Recent Stories In the News Inside Carolina Carolinian University Events Athletics Study Study at South Carolina Majors and Degrees at South Carolina Undergraduate Education Graduate Education Online Education Colleges and Schools College of Arts and Sciences Darla Moore School of Business College of Education College of Engineering and Computing The Graduate School College of Hospitality, Retail and Sport Management Joseph F. Rice School of Law College of Information and Communications School of Medicine Columbia School of Medicine Greenville School of Music College of Nursing College of Pharmacy Arnold School of Public Health College of Social Work South Carolina Honors College Libraries and Collections Thomas Cooper Library Digital Collections Educational Film Collection Elliot White Springs Business Library Karesh Law Library Library Annex and Conservation Facility Music Library Moving Images Research Collections Irvin Department of Rare Books and Special Collections School of Medicine Library South Carolina Political Collections South Caroliniana Library Continuing Education Experience Experience South Carolina Living Here Dining Clubs and Organizations Sports and Outdoors Arts and Entertainment Inclusive Excellence University 101 My USC Experience My USC Experience Engagements Academic Support Career Prep Study Abroad Visit Visit Campus Individual Visits Tour Tips Guest Accessibility Services Group Visits Self-Guided Visits Virtual Tour Explore Columbia Campus Map Admissions Admissions at South Carolina Undergraduate Admissions Graduate School Admissions University Applications Tuition and Aid Research Research at South Carolina Research Opportunities Breakthrough Research Breakthrough Research Partnership Opportunities About About South Carolina South Carolina at a Glance Our Leadership University President Request for Remarks Presidential Communications A New Beginning 2022 Holiday Card Design Contest Presidential Investiture University Officials Offices and Divisions Signature Events Carolina Welcome State of the University Prepared Remarks Prepared Remarks Family Weekend USC Homecoming Imagine Carolina MLK Celebration Awards Day Awards Day Recipients Commencement Our History Directory Search Employment Student Employment News & Events USC News & Events Recent Stories In the News Inside Carolina Subscription Confirmation Carolinian University Events Athletics Tools & Resources Calendar Map Directory Apply Give Student Gateway Faculty & Staff Gateway Parents & Families Gateway Alumni Gateway SC.edu Experience Career Prep Career Prep Career management starts long before you graduate from the University of South Carolina.\n                        As a student, it’s easy to get started on a more successful future. One of your biggest goals other than earning your diploma? Starting a career path\n                           that’ll benefit you for years to come. While you’re a student, we’re already working\n                           to help you be as successful as possible once you leave our gates. Start working with the university's Career Center to give your future a valuable head\n                           start. Visit for one-on-one conversations about your interests and goals or connect\n                           with career-building internships that can add skills and value to you resume. At South\n                           Carolina, we're committed to helping our students and graduates get connected and\n                           stay connected. Megan Gallagher’s five-month internship with Southwest Airlines led to a coveted role\n                                 as a campus brand ambassador during her time as a student. Pre-health fraternity Alpha Epsilon Delta brought in an emergency medical transport\n                                 crew to introduce students to their role and show them the helicopter and its lifesaving\n                                 equipment. Career Services Students and alumni can further their career skills and job experience with help from\n                              the campus-based Career Center . The center has virtual tools as well as a network of locations around campus to\n                              assist with career development, job searching, interviews and more. Plan Your Career Get expert help understanding your capabilities, interests and strengths, choosing\n                                       a career, or preparing for a job or graduate school search. Gain Experience Explore a career through an introductory internship, co-op or part-time job to gather real-world\n                                       insight about a potential field of interest. Find a Job Use Handshake to streamline your job search, apply for open positions and find out\n                                       about job fairs and events, and to network with employers. Internships & Income Among 2022-23 graduates, those who completed an internship earned $8,129 more than\n                              students who did not. Over 10 years, that translates into over $80,000 in earnings. The average salary for those who participated in an internship experience and received\n                                 full-time employment was more than $6 6,500. South Carolina has more than 360,000 alumni so you can often connect with fellow Gamecocks\n                              who are leaders in your chosen profession or working at your targeted employer. WORK ON CAMPUS When it comes to jobs, there are many valuable learning opportunities all over campus.\n                              Build key workplace skills like professionalism, public speaking and time management\n                              while working for an employer that cares about your academic endeavors, too. Student Employment Launch your tomorrow, today. South Carolina's friendly campus, prime location, award-winning academics, student-focused\n                              services, and loyal alumni are sure to deliver the kind of college experience that’ll\n                              benefit you for years to come. Get started on your admissions application right now. Undergraduate Admissions USC Facebook USC Instagram USC X Colleges & Schools Arts and Sciences Business Education Engineering and Computing The Graduate School Hospitality, Retail and Sport Management Information and Communications Law Medicine Medicine (Greenville) Music Nursing Pharmacy Public Health Social Work South Carolina Honors College Palmetto College Offices & Divisions Employment Undergraduate Admissions Financial Aid and Scholarships Bursar (fee payment) Veterans and Military Services Disability Resources Access and Opportunity Human Resources Law Enforcement and Safety University Libraries All Offices and Divisions Tools Carolina Alert Campus Email my.sc.edu Blackboard Campus Safety and Wellness PeopleSoft Finance © University of South Carolina Privacy Student Consumer Information Student Consumer Information Transparency Initiative Civil Rights and Title IX Digital Accessibility Contact ©"
    },
    "https://www.sc.edu/about/offices_and_divisions/career_center/index.php": {
      "title": "Tools & Resources",
      "description": "Career Center - Career Center | University of South Carolina Skip to Content University of South Carolina Home Search University of South Carolina University of South Carolina Navigation Search sc.edu Gateways For: STUDENTS FACULTY & STAFF ALUMNI PARENTS & FAMILIES Calendar Map Directory Apply Give Search sc.edu Search Career Center Student Career Hub Plan a Career Career Coaching Assessment Tools Decision Making Process Career Courses Gain Experience Internships and Co-ops Carolina Internship Program Informational Interviewing Job Shadowing Job Shadowing for Employers Job Shadowing for Students Code of Conduct Part-Time Jobs Write a Resume Chronological Resume Curriculum Vitae Federal Resume Cover Letters Prep for Interviews Pre-Interview Research Practice Interviews On-Campus Interviews Search for Jobs Job Fairs and Events Information Sessions Job Postings Networking Explore Graduate School Use Career Center Tools Access Financial Support Cocky Career Guides Carolina Career Competencies Graduate Student Advising Employer Partnerships Post Your Vacancies Recruit a Gamecock Career Fairs Host an In-person or Virtual event Interviewing Build Internships & Co-Ops Develop Your Recruitment Strategy Become a Partner Most Engaged Employers Faculty Partnerships Classroom Presentations Letters of Reference Employer Referrals Career Champion Events for Faculty and Staff Alumni Support Assessment and Coaching Job Fairs and Events Search for Jobs Interview Preparation On-Campus Interviewing Managing Your Handshake Alumni Account Data & Outcomes About the Career Center Our Location Staff Directory Contact Us Policies No Show Policy Career Center Tools Social Media Extended Virtual Services Tools & Resources Calendar Map Directory Apply Give Student Gateway Faculty & Staff Gateway Parents & Families Gateway Alumni Gateway Career Center South Carolina Internship Program (SCIP) Are you working at an internship or co-op in a high-demand industry in South Carolina? Apply today for a $3,000 supplement! SC.edu About Offices and Divisions Career Center Career Center Student Career Hub Graduate Student Advising Employer Partnerships Faculty Partnerships Alumni Support Data & Outcomes About the Career Center Your career journey starts here. Whether you're exploring majors, preparing for internships,\n                           or launching into life after graduation, we're here to help you build skills, discover\n                           options, and connect with opportunities that move you forward. Every year, thousands\n                           of students gain clarity and confidence through our programs — from choosing a major\n                           to landing that first job — made possible by a community that believes in student\n                           career success. Support the University Career Center If you’re passionate about helping Gamecocks step boldly into their futures, we invite\n                                    you to support the Career Center programs that make this impact possible. Your contribution fuels real opportunities, real growth, and real futures. Whatever you're aiming for, we'll help you get there. Carolina Career Competencies Learn the skills you need to grow and succeed professionally. Four Year Career Plans Four years. One roadmap. We’ve got you from freshman year to career launch. Career Coaching Talk it out, map it out — your next move starts here. Assessments Discover your strengths, values, and vibe — so your career actually fits YOU. Cocky Career Guides Step-by-step resources for job search, internships and everything in between. Graduate Student Advising Advanced goals need advanced guidance — we’re here to help you get there. Career Docs Build a résumé that makes employers stop scrolling and start reading. Interview Essentials Walk in confident and ready, walk out knowing you nailed it. LinkedIn Literacy From headshot to headline, level up your LinkedIn like a pro. Internships & Co-ops Real-world experience, zero fluff — your time to explore, learn and earn. South Carolina Internship Program (SCIP) Your South Carolina internship just got more rewarding — literally. Find a Job From part-time to post-grad — start your job search with confidence. Events Career-powered gatherings where opportunities meet you. Career Center Tools All the career gear in one place — from job search to skill builder. Cocky Career Ready Your 24/7 AI career sidekick — anytime tips, on-demand, always ready. Data & Outcomes See what past Gamecocks are doing, so you can chart your own path forward. Iris Headshot Booth Main character energy — now in professional lighting. Employer Partnerships Recruit, connect, and grow your presence on campus. Career Center Location Contact Calendar Social Media USC Facebook USC Instagram USC X Colleges & Schools Arts and Sciences Business Education Engineering and Computing The Graduate School Hospitality, Retail and Sport Management Information and Communications Law Medicine Medicine (Greenville) Music Nursing Pharmacy Public Health Social Work South Carolina Honors College Palmetto College Offices & Divisions Employment Undergraduate Admissions Financial Aid and Scholarships Bursar (fee payment) Veterans and Military Services Disability Resources Access and Opportunity Human Resources Law Enforcement and Safety University Libraries All Offices and Divisions Tools Carolina Alert Campus Email my.sc.edu Blackboard Campus Safety and Wellness PeopleSoft Finance © University of South Carolina Privacy Student Consumer Information Student Consumer Information Transparency Initiative Civil Rights and Title IX Digital Accessibility Contact Challenge the conventional. Create the exceptional. No Limits. ©"
    },
    "https://www.sc.edu/about/offices_and_divisions/career_center/student_career_hub/plan_a_career/index.php": {
