    "https://www.sc.edu/about/offices_and_divisions/career_center/student_career_hub/gain_experience/": {
      "title": "Tools & Resources",
      "description": "Gain Experience - Career Center | University of South Carolina Skip to Content University of South Carolina Home Search University of South Carolina University of South Carolina Navigation Search sc.edu Gateways For: STUDENTS FACULTY & STAFF ALUMNI PARENTS & FAMILIES Calendar Map Directory Apply Give Search sc.edu Search Career Center Student Career Hub Plan a Career Career Coaching Assessment Tools Decision Making Process Career Courses Gain Experience Internships and Co-ops Carolina Internship Program Informational Interviewing Job Shadowing Job Shadowing for Employers Job Shadowing for Students Code of Conduct Part-Time Jobs Write a Resume Chronological Resume Curriculum Vitae Federal Resume Cover Letters Prep for Interviews Pre-Interview Research Practice Interviews On-Campus Interviews Search for Jobs Job Fairs and Events Information Sessions Job Postings Networking Explore Graduate School Use Career Center Tools Access Financial Support Cocky Career Guides Carolina Career Competencies Graduate Student Advising Employer Partnerships Post Your Vacancies Recruit a Gamecock Career Fairs Host an In-person or Virtual event Interviewing Build Internships & Co-Ops Develop Your Recruitment Strategy Become a Partner Most Engaged Employers Faculty Partnerships Classroom Presentations Letters of Reference Employer Referrals Career Champion Events for Faculty and Staff Alumni Support Assessment and Coaching Job Fairs and Events Search for Jobs Interview Preparation On-Campus Interviewing Managing Your Handshake Alumni Account Data & Outcomes About the Career Center Our Location Staff Directory Contact Us Policies No Show Policy Career Center Tools Social Media Extended Virtual Services Tools & Resources Calendar Map Directory Apply Give Student Gateway Faculty & Staff Gateway Parents & Families Gateway Alumni Gateway Career Center SC.edu About Offices and Divisions Career Center Student Services Gain Experience Career Center Student Career Hub Graduate Student Advising Employer Partnerships Faculty Partnerships Alumni Support Data & Outcomes About the Career Center Plan a Career Gain Experience Write a Resume Prep for Interviews Search for Jobs Explore Graduate School Use Career Center Tools Access Financial Support Cocky Career Guides Carolina Career Competencies Internships and Co-ops Informational Interviewing Job Shadowing Part-Time Jobs Gain Experience Find out if a career is right for you by starting out now in an internship, co-op\n                        or part time job. You'll meet industry leaders and gain invaluable insight as you\n                        experience your target career firsthand. We can help you get started. Internships and Co-ops Obtain an internship or co-op to apply your academic knowledge, while gaining real-life\n                                             experience. You'll have the opportunity to develop a variety of skills while learning\n                                             more about your field of interest. Informational Interviewing Conduct an informational interview to learn more about careers that interest you and\n                                             begin networking with professionals in your chosen field. Job Shadowing Consider job shadowing if you want to learn more about a specific role and how it\n                                             may relate to your future goals. Part-Time Jobs Consider working part-time while going to school.  There are part-time jobs available\n                                             on and off campus. Access Financial Support Learn more about opportunities to obtain funding for career-related experiences and\n                                             professional development. Career Center Location Contact Calendar Social Media USC Facebook USC Instagram USC X Colleges & Schools Arts and Sciences Business Education Engineering and Computing The Graduate School Hospitality, Retail and Sport Management Information and Communications Law Medicine Medicine (Greenville) Music Nursing Pharmacy Public Health Social Work South Carolina Honors College Palmetto College Offices & Divisions Employment Undergraduate Admissions Financial Aid and Scholarships Bursar (fee payment) Veterans and Military Services Disability Resources Access and Opportunity Human Resources Law Enforcement and Safety University Libraries All Offices and Divisions Tools Carolina Alert Campus Email my.sc.edu Blackboard Campus Safety and Wellness PeopleSoft Finance © University of South Carolina Privacy Student Consumer Information Student Consumer Information Transparency Initiative Civil Rights and Title IX Digital Accessibility Contact Challenge the conventional. Create the exceptional. No Limits. ©"
