    "https://www.sc.edu/about/offices_and_divisions/career_center/student_career_hub/search_for_jobs/index.php": {
      "title": "Tools & Resources",
      "description": "Search for Jobs - Career Center | University of South Carolina Skip to Content University of South Carolina Home Search University of South Carolina University of South Carolina Navigation Search sc.edu Gateways For: STUDENTS FACULTY & STAFF ALUMNI PARENTS & FAMILIES Calendar Map Directory Apply Give Search sc.edu Search Career Center Student Career Hub Plan a Career Career Coaching Assessment Tools Decision Making Process Career Courses Gain Experience Internships and Co-ops Carolina Internship Program Informational Interviewing Job Shadowing Job Shadowing for Employers Job Shadowing for Students Code of Conduct Part-Time Jobs Write a Resume Chronological Resume Curriculum Vitae Federal Resume Cover Letters Prep for Interviews Pre-Interview Research Practice Interviews On-Campus Interviews Search for Jobs Job Fairs and Events Information Sessions Job Postings Networking Explore Graduate School Use Career Center Tools Access Financial Support Cocky Career Guides Carolina Career Competencies Graduate Student Advising Employer Partnerships Post Your Vacancies Recruit a Gamecock Career Fairs Host an In-person or Virtual event Interviewing Build Internships & Co-Ops Develop Your Recruitment Strategy Become a Partner Most Engaged Employers Faculty Partnerships Classroom Presentations Letters of Reference Employer Referrals Career Champion Events for Faculty and Staff Alumni Support Assessment and Coaching Job Fairs and Events Search for Jobs Interview Preparation On-Campus Interviewing Managing Your Handshake Alumni Account Data & Outcomes About the Career Center Our Location Staff Directory Contact Us Policies No Show Policy Career Center Tools Social Media Extended Virtual Services Tools & Resources Calendar Map Directory Apply Give Student Gateway Faculty & Staff Gateway Parents & Families Gateway Alumni Gateway Career Center SC.edu About Offices and Divisions Career Center Student Services Search for Jobs Career Center Student Career Hub Graduate Student Advising Employer Partnerships Faculty Partnerships Alumni Support Data & Outcomes About the Career Center Plan a Career Gain Experience Write a Resume Prep for Interviews Search for Jobs Explore Graduate School Use Career Center Tools Access Financial Support Cocky Career Guides Carolina Career Competencies Job Fairs and Events Job Postings Networking Search for Jobs The Career Center can help you plan a career that works with your major, explore the\n                        experiences that match your goals, polish your resume and prep for interviews. Now\n                        its time to go to work and find the job that's right for you. It all starts with a Handshake Handshake is the Career Center's online career management platform. Employers partner\n                                 with us to post open positions through Handshake. Students and alumni use it to search\n                                 positions, post resumes, sign up for on-campus interviews, find out about job fairs\n                                 and events and network with employers. All newly enrolled students will be automatically added. You will have access and\n                                 be able to log in after you have attended orientation and been fully enrolled in classes. Simply sign in with\n                                 your USC email and password to set up your account and start exploring opportunities. Need help? Contact the Career Center! Requesting a new account will delay your access. Login to Handshake Important information about requesting a Handshake account Job Fairs and Events We host several distinct career fairs every year to connect students with employers\n                                             from various industries. Job Postings Whether you are searching for a part-time or full-time job, countless employment opportunities\n                                             await. Networking The earlier you begin meeting people with common career interests, the more resources\n                                             you will have to call on when you need a job. USC Grads: Tell Us What You're Doing Next! Fill out the graduation survey and share with us! Need help with your next steps? Career Coaches are still here to support you. Make an appointment today! Avoid Job Scams Stay safe from job scams by searching for opportunities through the University's official\n                                    career management platform , Handshake. Here are other precautions to help you stay safe. Reserve an Interview Room Need a quiet place to conduct your virtual interviews? We have a suite of technology\n                                    equipped interview rooms available. Click here to learn more and reserve your room. Career Center Location Contact Calendar Social Media USC Facebook USC Instagram USC X Colleges & Schools Arts and Sciences Business Education Engineering and Computing The Graduate School Hospitality, Retail and Sport Management Information and Communications Law Medicine Medicine (Greenville) Music Nursing Pharmacy Public Health Social Work South Carolina Honors College Palmetto College Offices & Divisions Employment Undergraduate Admissions Financial Aid and Scholarships Bursar (fee payment) Veterans and Military Services Disability Resources Access and Opportunity Human Resources Law Enforcement and Safety University Libraries All Offices and Divisions Tools Carolina Alert Campus Email my.sc.edu Blackboard Campus Safety and Wellness PeopleSoft Finance © University of South Carolina Privacy Student Consumer Information Student Consumer Information Transparency Initiative Civil Rights and Title IX Digital Accessibility Contact Challenge the conventional. Create the exceptional. No Limits. ©"
    },
